abstract: >
  A 60-minute hands-on workshop that traces how bias embedded in the eGFR
  kidney function formula propagates through three stages of a clinical data
  pipeline — measurement, modeling, and medication eligibility — using real
  CDC NHANES data with linked mortality outcomes.
